#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:4 8d228976efde419d9b3dbd02d1ee0393
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:7 23c8c316178b45ac98a0da0d41986c0a
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Goals"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:9 82de635588e6456d82e12d4742987b79
msgid ""
"用 5 分钟走完平台最常见的 6 个任务。**跟着本节操作即可完成首次使用**， 每个步骤都给出具体按钮和字段名。如需深入了解某个功能，可跳转到 "
"对应章节阅读。"
msgstr ""
"Complete the six most common platform tasks in about 5 minutes. **Follow "
"this section for your first use**--each step names the exact buttons and "
"fields. For deeper coverage, jump to the linked chapters."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:14 5423ef8fe28c4f8784c33a4c6c556226
msgid "完整 5 分钟任务链"
msgstr "Full 5-minute task chain"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:16 f53cf9d2a3ec4511be6707007254721e
msgid "本节串起以下 6 个连续任务，从登录后的工作台开始，到工作结束："
msgstr ""
"This section walks through six consecutive tasks from the post-login "
"workbench to finishing your session:"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:18 4c1f2261305d4c5eafb55184f218bff6
msgid "认识工作台"
msgstr "Explore the workbench"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:19 f6155bf8028d4a6fb9549d177d17eb59
msgid "启动一个应用（Jupyter Lab）"
msgstr "Launch an application (Jupyter Lab)"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:20 645b9ee0aa654495a9574c1e6c4ffebd
msgid "查看刚才启动的作业"
msgstr "View the job you just started"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:21 7455779d1fb24629a5f4c6b622732974
msgid "上传一个临时测试文件"
msgstr "Upload a temporary test file"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:22 2ff178f7ca3b469cb6842e4620ae5150
msgid "提交一个测试工单"
msgstr "Submit a test ticket"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:23 46e8ca4d21584192b9759343d0b1a4e0
msgid "提交一个配额申请（示例）"
msgstr "Submit a quota request (example)"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:27 44757bb79e89439c94fb87e6dfbad92a
msgid "任务 1：认识工作台"
msgstr "Task 1: Explore the workbench"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:29 ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:53
#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:87 ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:111
#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:142 ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:181
#: 1b41e7d3c29346b49934f665cc42ea46 390ca3c94b314628aa70f3d4a389e42d
#: 3ab5d8ca439646ecadf74d2af1df403f 4be43d8c59d44ce88945e64ea6fcf63f
#: 76eb34cc94684ac7971c6447def94051 faff5fe4a2684c6baf14ca3478e0f8ba
msgid "**操作步骤**："
msgstr "**Steps:**"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:31 78985fbd09f544eeabc9787f00b2c139
msgid "登录成功后，浏览器自动跳转到工作台。"
msgstr ""
"After a successful login, the browser opens the workbench automatically."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:32 d1a3a387c07f4cf385b7a9efb0e86da8
msgid "工作台顶部是 ``快捷操作`` 卡片，包含 3 个按钮：``应用管理``、 ``通知中心``、``帮助文档``。"
msgstr ""
"At the top of the workbench is the ``Quick Actions`` card with three "
"buttons: ``Application Management``, ``Notification Center``, and ``Help``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:34 b08bc9e4999f4908b229ace80da9f0ee
msgid "工作台中部是 ``作业统计`` 卡片。"
msgstr "The center of the workbench shows the ``Job Statistics`` card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:35 22788bca50dd4f3aa9c77036066cf4cc
msgid "工作台右侧是 ``账户概览``、``平台通知`` 和 ``平台状态`` 卡片。"
msgstr ""
"On the right are ``Account Overview``, ``Platform Notifications``, and "
"``Platform Status``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:36 ab318da8ebca44c1b6b79851483dcfbf
msgid "工作台下方是 ``我的项目组`` 卡片，列出当前账号所属项目组。"
msgstr ""
"Below is ``My Project Groups``, listing project groups for your account."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:42 112a2dd9723b4ab7b40126264fd68813
msgid "工作台"
msgstr "Workbench"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:42 fceac5dcaf204d47be45b738aef40571
msgid "工作台全景。可点击 ``快捷操作`` 中的 ``应用管理`` 进入应用列表。"
msgstr ""
"Workbench overview. Click ``Application Management`` under ``Quick Actions``"
" to open the application list."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:46 77d1213a10004a3987436a5654f7dfe6
msgid "``工作台`` 是登录后的默认首页。也可点击左侧菜单 ``工作台`` 随时 回到此页。"
msgstr ""
"``Workbench`` is the default home page after login. Use the left menu "
"``Workbench`` to return anytime."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:51 0c2ab269f42b4398a972927a6a29c631
msgid "任务 2：启动一个应用（Jupyter Lab）"
msgstr "Task 2: Launch an application (Jupyter Lab)"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:55 243076314bd34d43891fbf9c4e9723a5
msgid "在左侧菜单点击 ``应用列表``，进入应用列表页面。"
msgstr ""
"In the left menu, click ``Application List`` to open the application list "
"page."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:56 4082a43b789c4862a48fa0c9c368c621
msgid "页面中部是应用卡片网格，找到 ``Jupyter Lab`` 卡片。"
msgstr "In the application card grid, find the ``Jupyter Lab`` card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:57 53fcee08b6834f1a9572a0ebc9984b40
msgid ""
"启动非 Terminal 类应用前，可在卡片的 ``项目组`` 行下拉选择本次 任务要计费的项目组，例如 ``2026 Summer "
"School``；不选择项目组 则个人承担相关计费。其他资源参数如有需要可调整。"
msgstr ""
"Before starting a non-Terminal app, use the ``Project Group`` dropdown on "
"the card to choose which group is billed--for example ``2026 Summer "
"School``. If none is selected, charges apply to your personal account. "
"Adjust other resource fields as needed."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:60 722b0dac25d74e5ba84d54c184f89cd5
msgid "点击卡片上的 ``启 动`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click ``Start`` on the card."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:61 609248951ced4ea4a2b31c056c1e53b7
msgid "等待几秒，**浏览器自动弹出新窗口**，新窗口中显示 Jupyter Lab 界 面，包含左侧文件浏览器和右侧 Notebook 工作区。"
msgstr ""
"Wait a few seconds; **the browser opens a new window** showing Jupyter Lab "
"with the file browser on the left and the Notebook workspace on the right."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:68 2076f95ed7294e0cb2e49a64a80781b8
msgid "应用卡片"
msgstr "Application cards"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:68 96e34bf31ef2463792e300482efff8b0
msgid "应用卡片网格：``Terminal``、``Jupyter Lab``、``Linux Desktop``、 ``vscode`` 等。"
msgstr ""
"Application card grid: ``Terminal``, ``Jupyter Lab``, ``Linux Desktop``, "
"``vscode``, etc."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:75 9369b195f5be4fb9b4de728ce9edf875
msgid "Jupyter Lab 启动后界面"
msgstr "Jupyter Lab after launch"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:75 4274f55d295043a7a315507b3a68db9c
msgid ""
"点击 ``启 动`` 后浏览器自动弹出的 Jupyter Lab 界面。左侧是文件浏 览器，右侧是 Notebook "
"工作区，可以新建文件、运行命令和编辑代码。"
msgstr ""
"Jupyter Lab opened after clicking ``Start``. The file browser is on the left"
" and the Notebook workspace on the right; you can create files, run "
"commands, and edit code."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:80 88014e1266324895a0c547f4026cba29
msgid "关闭浏览器窗口不会自动停止 Jupyter Lab 等应用。完成工作后必须 回到 ``应用列表`` 页面点击 ``关 闭`` 才能释放资源。"
msgstr ""
"Closing the browser window does not stop Jupyter Lab and similar apps. When "
"finished, return to ``Application List`` and click ``Close`` to release "
"resources."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:85 cb3151a7148e4423b82f62169eeec48a
msgid "任务 3：查看刚才启动的作业"
msgstr "Task 3: View the job you just started"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:89 d5e6678039fc4f32b2829d821c0c216f
msgid "切回 ``应用列表`` 页面（在浏览器已经打开的标签页中切换）。"
msgstr "Switch back to the ``Application List`` tab in your browser."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:90 eb6d283aacf940c2abe9aa1e2eaaa97a
msgid ""
"页面底部是 ``作业列表`` 表格，列包含 ``作业ID``、``作业名称``、 ``分区``、``状态``、``提交时间``、``耗时`` 等。"
msgstr ""
"At the bottom, the ``Job List`` table includes ``Job ID``, ``Job Name``, "
"``Partition``, ``Status``, ``Submit Time``, ``Duration``, and more."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:92 4af61890bf4d4e959165cbee2aef89f5
msgid ""
"在列表中找到刚才启动的 Jupyter Lab 作业（作业名称如 ``JupyterLab_<用户名>`` 或类似），确认 ``状态`` 列显示为 "
"``运行中``。"
msgstr ""
"Find the Jupyter Lab job you started (name like ``JupyterLab_<username>``) "
"and confirm ``Status`` shows ``Running``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:99 e1617cc4b43047918ce1be3cf47dd31b
msgid "作业列表"
msgstr "Job list"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:99 fb1aff88c79e429fabd803c6f069f76c
msgid "``应用列表`` 页面底部的 ``作业列表``，刚才启动的 Jupyter Lab 作业 显示在列表中，状态为 ``运行中``。"
msgstr ""
"``Job List`` at the bottom of ``Application List``; your Jupyter Lab job "
"appears with status ``Running``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:104 99581a5762b54bef954c36c9087dcacb
msgid "也可以点击顶部 ``批处理作业`` 标签查看所有作业（含批处理提交的 作业）。普通用户日常最常用的是 ``交互式应用`` 标签下的作业列表。"
msgstr ""
"You can also open the ``Batch Jobs`` tab for all jobs. Day to day, most "
"users use the list under ``Interactive Applications``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:109 11384217d007461e9e51a8e89ff3e2f6
msgid "任务 4：上传一个临时测试文件"
msgstr "Task 4: Upload a temporary test file"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:113 2b43c9b78dd74b9e84bba14d7ffd7f4a
msgid "在左侧菜单点击 ``文件管理``，进入个人文件页面。"
msgstr ""
"In the left menu, click ``File Management`` to open your personal files."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:114 639db9c9d7ea499f8a6055285b3c4f2e
msgid "页面顶部工具栏找到 ``上传文件`` 按钮。"
msgstr "In the toolbar, find ``Upload File``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:115 98b6ddafdde640b7ad35f24bce0dd495
msgid "点击 ``上传文件`` 按钮，在弹出对话框中再次点击 ``上 传 文 件`` 选 择本地小文件。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``Upload File``, then in the dialog click ``Upload File`` again to "
"choose a small local file."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:117 d316b0c78d4240388d735eeb7d3a6716
msgid "在弹出对话框中点击 ``OK``，看到文件出现在列表中即上传成功。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``OK`` in the dialog; the file appears in the list when upload "
"succeeds."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:123 c07feac9e6754fc896dfc8aad45f218a
msgid "文件管理"
msgstr "File management"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:123 4cf8e148a60c4acab03a84ec6c55a42f
msgid "``文件管理`` 页面，顶部 ``返回上一级`` ``新建文件夹`` ``上传文件`` 按钮。"
msgstr ""
"``File Management`` page with ``Go Up``, ``New Folder``, and ``Upload File``"
" in the toolbar."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:130 b58289a3bdea42baa01cb8516066d925
msgid "上传文件对话框"
msgstr "Upload file dialog"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:130 2395db988e634a088837c52a06410d77
msgid "点击 ``上传文件`` 后弹出的对话框，再点击 ``上 传 文 件`` 选择本 地文件。"
msgstr ""
"Dialog after ``Upload File``; click ``Upload File`` again to select a local "
"file."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:135 719040a127e248ee943ec59a2e2dcc77
msgid ""
"建议上传一个临时小文件（如 ``test.txt``，内容写 ``manual test``） 验证流程即可。**不要上传真实业务数据** "
"或占用大量磁盘空间的文件。"
msgstr ""
"Upload a small temporary file (e.g., ``test.txt`` with content ``manual "
"test``) to verify the flow. **Do not upload real business data** or large "
"files."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:140 a763176ede694fd29db55e0ffc033215
msgid "任务 5：提交一个测试工单"
msgstr "Task 5: Submit a test ticket"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:144 e005dadd314548ac88ffa67ca5ee9e8e
msgid "在左侧菜单点击 ``工单管理``，进入工单页面。"
msgstr "In the left menu, click ``Ticket Management``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:145 7a4ab3ed5601475fab29910ca0888d1b
msgid "页面默认显示 ``提交工单`` 表单。"
msgstr "The ``Submit Ticket`` form is shown by default."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:146 48da169e374e4bcf868289d059df8231
msgid "在 ``工单标题`` 输入框中输入 ``手册流程验证``。"
msgstr "In ``Ticket Title``, enter ``Manual workflow verification``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:147 5fa22ddb9d9b4d949bef88fb134c2912
msgid "``工单分类`` 默认 ``其他``，可保持不变。"
msgstr "``Ticket Category`` defaults to ``Other``; you can leave it."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:148 185bbe7cb0324a2b85a446395e66cf0a
msgid "``优先级`` 默认 ``普通``，可保持不变。"
msgstr "``Priority`` defaults to ``Normal``; you can leave it."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:149 982d05c7fad949ae8ee097b517ca6458
msgid "在 ``工单描述`` 文本框中输入：``本工单仅用于用户手册的流程验证，无需处理。``"
msgstr ""
"In the ``Ticket description`` box, enter: ``This ticket is only for user-"
"guide workflow verification and needs no action.``"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:151 73aaa6b8a1604ead9a4acb64894df25f
msgid "点击 ``提交工单`` 按钮，看到成功提示。"
msgstr "Click ``Submit Ticket`` and confirm the success message."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:152 91b46cfae5b94371a3c0a9ee1bc3d741
msgid "切换到 ``我的工单`` 标签，找到刚提交的工单，确认状态。"
msgstr ""
"Open ``My Tickets``, find the ticket you submitted, and check its status."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:158 10c3bb07b6ee424288d9dfe2276f7714
msgid "提交工单表单"
msgstr "Submit ticket form"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:158 596157b87f0341ebb30b715ea9588419
msgid "``提交工单`` 表单，含标题、分类、优先级、描述字段。"
msgstr ""
"``Submit Ticket`` form with title, category, priority, and description."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:164 8fc4e384a8bd4379a17acbfe49bc5fa9
msgid "工单填写示例"
msgstr "Ticket fill-in example"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:164 4ce76c16e40042eea59c1a87a8341c41
msgid "工单填写示例。填写完成后点击 ``提交工单`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Example ticket. Click ``Submit Ticket`` when done."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:170 dc404afe0c644da2b04d4ef567d4607a
msgid "我的工单"
msgstr "My tickets"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:170 d5ed2fabf9e1442aae684204e47e0c87
msgid "``我的工单`` 列表，刚提交的工单出现在列表中。"
msgstr "``My Tickets`` list showing your newly submitted ticket."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:174 d3c318b05498423a902f5efb92d765d7
msgid "本工单只是验证流程的测试工单，**不包含真实业务问题**。如确实遇 到平台问题，请重新提交正式工单并详细描述。"
msgstr ""
"This ticket is only to verify the workflow and **is not a real issue**. For "
"actual problems, submit a formal ticket with details."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:179 d58d775227d44634802a03a56f73856f
msgid "任务 6：提交一个配额申请"
msgstr "Task 6: Submit a quota request"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:183 96aac5e2d31043e9afdc228e1a3098dd
msgid "在左侧菜单点击 ``配额申请``，进入配额申请页面。"
msgstr "In the left menu, click ``Quota Request``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:184 c21c1b6849d44947a21b7373b9f76346
msgid "点击右上角 ``新建申请`` 按钮，弹出 ``新建配额申请`` 表单。"
msgstr "Click ``New Request`` to open the ``New Quota Request`` form."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:185 718370e13da64afab4927caf2bf1a898
msgid "填写表单字段："
msgstr "Fill in the form:"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:187 830b16341dc74a6d9a392c228ddcface
msgid "``申请金额（元）``：填 ``0`` 表示仅验证流程，不申请实际金额。"
msgstr ""
"``Requested amount (CNY)``: enter ``0`` to verify the flow without "
"requesting funds."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:188 4714772e26264e119d9634a5edacd32d
msgid "``期望 CPU 配额（核数，可选）``：填 ``80`` 表示默认配额上限。"
msgstr ""
"``Desired CPU quota (cores, optional)``: ``80`` matches the default cap."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:189 0416468e973f4dbfb1b3dbf6ac05312a
msgid "``期望存储空间（可选）``：填 ``10`` 表示 10 GB。"
msgstr "``Desired storage (optional)``: ``10`` means 10 GB."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:190 05817a015e45438b82dc89268eef20b7
msgid "``所属项目组（可选）``：不填则为个人申请。"
msgstr "``Project group (optional)``: leave blank for a personal request."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:191 07366e46a8c64482ae9aff568fd3c832
msgid "``申请理由``：填 ``手册流程验证，无需处理。``"
msgstr "``Reason``: enter ``Manual workflow verification; no action needed.``"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:193 07d450c2305b47539d7d14c8327dc7cc
msgid "点击 ``提 交`` 按钮，看到成功提示。"
msgstr "Click ``Submit`` and confirm the success message."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:194 2b9838c18cbb43798c46484c98d17298
msgid "申请出现在 ``我的申请`` 列表中，状态为 ``待审批``。"
msgstr ""
"The request appears under ``My Requests`` with status ``Pending approval``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:200 251034f96c274f3b86150442326d5c3f
msgid "配额申请页面"
msgstr "Quota request page"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:200 72b4f33a0391451ca389bcef4631da61
msgid "配额申请页面，含 ``我的申请`` 标签、``刷新`` 和 ``新建申请`` 按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Quota request page with ``My Requests``, ``Refresh``, and ``New Request``."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:206 8a003230977746e7a46be2399b2420cb
msgid "新建配额申请表单"
msgstr "New quota request form"

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:206 1a59c665e2c747578b471424af2b82d0
msgid "新建配额申请表单。"
msgstr "New quota request form."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:210 21b88d7cb55546f98775306307713ef0
msgid "配额申请仅作为本流程示例，实际申请请按真实需求填写金额和理由。"
msgstr ""
"Quota requests here are illustrative; use real amounts and reasons in "
"production."

#: ../../docs/jobs/quick-start.rst:211 ddfdfee8ff774e4c9e5fa85b08883c05
msgid "申请提交后状态为 ``待审批``，需管理员审批通过后配额才会到账。"
msgstr ""
"After submission, status is ``Pending approval`` until an administrator "
"approves it."

